  - AI governance
  - inter-rater reliability
  - Fleiss kappa
abstract: >-
  Python library for building, validating, and rating Domain120 lattices —
  domain-specific reasoning operator sets that generalize TRIZ's 40-principle
  structure across arbitrary domains of practice. Provides lattice data models,
  a validator with 6 ratification checks, a Fleiss' kappa calculator for
  inter-rater reliability (Severe Test 2), and CLI tooling.
